" Vim Abbreviations File
" This file contains common abbreviations for Vim
" Created: April 12, 2025
" Last Modified: April 12, 2025

" Common typos
iabbrev teh the
iabbrev adn and
iabbrev tthe the
iabbrev waht what
iabbrev tehn then
iabbrev taht that
iabbrev thier their
iabbrev recieve receive
iabbrev thsi this
iabbrev wiht with
iabbrev accomodate accommodate
iabbrev definately definitely
iabbrev seperate separate

" Date and time abbreviations
iabbrev ddate <C-R>=strftime("%Y-%m-%d")<CR>
iabbrev ttime <C-R>=strftime("%H:%M")<CR>
iabbrev dtime <C-R>=strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")<CR>

" Common phrases
iabbrev btw by the way
iabbrev fyi for your information
iabbrev afaik as far as I know
iabbrev imo in my opinion
iabbrev eg for example
iabbrev todo TODO:
iabbrev fixme FIXME:
iabbrev nb nota bene
iabbrev ps post scriptum

" Programming abbreviations
iabbrev fn function
iabbrev ret return
iabbrev pr print

" mine
iabbrev hip The Hearth of Islamic Philosophy
iabbrev hpos Hegel - Phenomenology of Spirit
iabbrev bm Behind the Mind 
iabbrev dk Divine Kingdom
iabbrev cl Cosmic Language


